554
00:20:05,660 --> 00:20:06,180
Precisely.

555
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:08,560
Now, usually in business schools,

556
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:09,500
the bullwhip effect

557
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:10,300
is taught purely

558
00:20:10,300 --> 00:20:11,200
